# ---- Vision + language model -------------------------------------------------
# PillPile needs one of these for reading photos and for plain-language wording.
# Without either, the app still runs: demo scenarios work, and every
# duplicate-ingredient, duplicate-class, dose-total and FDA-label interaction
# finding is still produced, because detection never uses a model.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Optional alternative provider.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# Force one provider when both keys are present: "gemini" | "anthropic"
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini

# ---- openFDA -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Without a key: ~240 requests/min and 1,000/day, which is enough for
# a demo but not for a room full of people trying it. Free key, takes a minute:
# https://open.fda.gov/apis/authentication/
OPENFDA_API_KEY=

# ---- ElevenLabs text-to-speech ----------------------------------------------
# Optional. Without it, "Read this aloud" falls back to the browser's built-in
# speech synthesis, so the accessibility feature never simply disappears.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Must be a PREMADE voice on the free tier - library voices return 402.
# Default is Sarah (reassuring). List yours: GET /v1/voices with your key.
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL
# ELEVENLABS_MODEL=eleven_multilingual_v2
# Audio is cached in .cache/tts by text hash, so demo replays cost no characters.

# ---- Demo resilience ---------------------------------------------------------
# Set to 1 to make any cache miss throw instead of hitting the network. Used by
# `npm run verify:offline` to prove the demo set is fully pre-cached.
# PILLPILE_OFFLINE=1
